Place at PSG Polytechnic College, Coimbatore."},{year:"2025",title:"Table Tennis - Divisional 1st & State 3rd",desc:"Harris Roger M (II Year Computer) secured Divisional 1st Place at SSM Polytechnic College and State 3rd Place at PSG Polytechnic College, Coimbatore."},{year:"2025",title:"Throw Ball Tournament - II Place",desc:"Apoorva SV (II Year Computer) and Naga Prithvi S (II Year Computer) secured 2nd place in the Throw Ball tournament at Shree Venkateshwara Hi-Tech Polytechnic College, Gobichettipalayam."}],events:[{date:"20 Aug 2026",title:"Association Session on 'What Does the Industry Actually Expect?'",type:"Association Function",speaker:"Mr. Suganth Krishna Eswaramoorthy",designation:"Product Specialist",organization:"TrusTrace, Coimbatore",desc:"The Computer Engineering Association organized an insightful session on 20.08.2026 on the topic “What Does the Industry Actually Expect?”. The session was led by Mr. Suganth Krishna Eswaramoorthy, Product Specialist, TrusTrace, Coimbatore, who shared valuable insights on current industry trends, technical skills, employability, and the importance of continuous learning. The session provided students with practical exposure to real-world industry expectations and motivated them to enhance their skills for future career opportunities.",outcomes:["Understand current tech industry trends and real-world employer expectations.","Gain valuable insights on core technical skills, employability, and industry readiness.","Recognize the importance of continuous learning and proactive skill development in tech careers.","Enhance career preparedness and motivation for future professional opportunities."],industryExposure:"Real-world industry benchmarks, employability standards, and skills roadmap by TrusTrace."},{date:"28-29 Jul 2026",title:"Field Trip to Kanavu Startup Village",type:"Field Trip",location:"Sivagiri",venue:"Kanavu Startup Village, Sivagiri",participants:"Computer Engineering Students and Faculty Members",desc:"The Department of Computer Engineering, Kongu Polytechnic College organized a field trip to Kanavu Startup Village, Sivagiri, on 28.07.2026 and 29.07.2026. The visit introduced students to the startup environment and entrepreneurial culture, providing them with an opportunity to explore innovative ideas, understand the journey of emerging ventures, and interact with the evolving startup ecosystem. The field trip encouraged students to think creatively, explore new possibilities, and develop an interest in innovation and entrepreneurship.",outcomes:["Explore firsthand the startup environment, venture incubation, and entrepreneurial culture.","Understand the lifecycle, challenges, and milestones of emerging technology ventures.","Interact with innovative minds and observe the evolving regional startup ecosystem.","Foster creative thinking, problem-solving, and inspiration for innovation and entrepreneurship."],industryExposure:"Direct immersion into entrepreneurial culture and emerging venture ecosystems at Kanavu Startup Village."},{date:"17 Feb 2026",title:"Guest Lecture on 'Hands on AI Tools'",type:"Guest Lecture",speaker:"Mr. K. ManiPrasanth, B.E.",designation:"Managing Director (Alumni of 2018 Batch)",organization:"Microssoft solutions, Tirupur",venue:"Dheeran Chinnamalai Seminar Hall",time:"10:30 A.M.",outcomes:["Understand the basic concepts of Artificial Intelligence and generative AI tools.","Develop awareness of responsible AI usage, data privacy, security concerns, and ethical considerations in AI-driven environments.","Analyze and evaluate the outputs generated by AI tools for accuracy and relevance.","Develop entrepreneurial and problem solving skills.","Empower participants with AI knowledge, critical thinking, ethical awareness, and innovation skills to thrive in the technology-driven future."]},{date:"01 Aug 2025",title:"Special Lecture on 'Recent Trends In IT'",type:"Special Lecture",speaker:"Mr. V. Gurumurthy, B.Tech.",designation:"Managing Director (Alumni of 2011 Batch)",organization:"Akra Group of Companies, Tirupur",venue:"Kalingarayan Seminar Hall",time:"10:00 A.M.",outcomes:["Explore and apply emerging technologies such as Artificial Intelligence, Cloud Computing, Internet of Things (IoT), and Network Security.","Analyze and utilize cloud-based services, networking technologies, and communication systems for real-world applications.","Understand the fundamental concepts, principles, and latest trends in Information Technology.","Acquire knowledge of modern IT tools, software applications, and computing technologies used in industry."]}],ivGallery:[{src:"/assets/departments/CSE/Association function memento.webp",title:"Association Function - Memento Presentation",desc:"Principal Dr. V. Chandrasekaran and faculty presenting a memento to Chief Guest Mr. Suganth Krishna Eswaramoorthy, Product Specialist at TrusTrace."},{src:"/assets/departments/CSE/Association function session.webp",title:"Association Session - Industry Expectations",desc:"Computer Engineering students attending the insightful session on 'What Does the Industry Actually Expect?' in the auditorium."},{src:"/assets/departments/CSE/Association function lamp lighting.webp",title:"Association Function - Lamp Lighting",desc:"Dignitaries and faculty lighting the ceremonial lamp during the inauguration of the Association Function."},{src:"/assets/departments/CSE/Field visit Kanavu Startup Village.webp",title:"Field Trip to Kanavu Startup Village",desc:"Computer Engineering students and faculty members exploring startup culture, entrepreneurship, and venture incubation at Kanavu Startup Village, Sivagiri."},{src:"/assets/departments/CSE/Field visit Kanavu Startup Village 2.webp",title:"Kanavu Startup Village Field Visit",desc:"Students exploring innovation opportunities and entrepreneurial ventures during the field visit to Kanavu Startup Village."},{src:"/assets/departments/CSE/Association function.webp",title:"Special Lecture on 'Recent Trends In IT'",desc:"Special guest lecture on recent IT trends by alumnus Mr. V. Gurumurthy."},{src:"/assets/departments/CSE/Valedictory function.webp",title:"Guest Lecture on 'Hands on AI Tools'",desc:"Interactive workshop and hands-on session on AI tools by alumnus Mr. K. ManiPrasanth."}],labGallery:[{src:"/assets/departments/selected/Selected CT/CT (1).webp",title:"Advanced Software Development Lab",desc:"High-performance workstations for Python, Java, and C++."},{src:"/assets/departments/selected/Selected CT/CT (4).webp",title:"Cloud Computing & AI Center",desc:"Modern computing terminals with AI and cloud tooling."},{src:"/assets/departments/selected/Selected CT/CT (5).webp",title:"Web Technologies & Database Lab",desc:"Full-stack development and relational database management."},{src:"/assets/departments/selected/Selected CT/CT (8).webp",title:"Open Source & Systems Programming Lab",desc:"Linux development environment and algorithm design workstations."}],vision:"To create the most conductive environment for quality academic and intelligent oriented Diploma education in computer engineering and prepare the students for a globalised technical society and involving them towards serving the society.",mission:["To provide an academic environment essential for technical skill, positive attitude, entrepreneurship, and intellectual development.","To make students aware of their societal and ethical responsibility for professionalism."],icon:(0,a.jsxs)("svg",{className:"w-6 h-6",fill:"none",stroke:"url(#dg-cse)",strokeWidth:"2",viewBox:"0 0 24 24",children:[(0,a.jsx)("defs",{children:(0,a.jsxs)("linearGradient",{id:"dg-cse",x1:"0%",y1:"0%",x2:"0%",y2:"100%",children:[(0,a.jsx)("stop",{offset:"0%",stopColor:"#91C04A"}),(0,a.jsx)("stop",{offset:"100%",stopColor:"#009EDB"})]})}),(0,a.jsx)("path",{strokeLinecap:"round",strokeLinejoin:"round",d:"M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"})]})},{id:"chem",slug:"chem",name:"Chemical Engineering",fullName:"Chemical Engineering",established:1994,intake:60,duration:"3 Years",syllabus:"/assets/departments/CHEM/1076 Chemical Engineering ....FINAL.pdf",image:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532187643603-ba119ca4109e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80",slogan:"Transforming molecules, engineering sustainable solutions.",description:"The Department of Chemical Engineering was established in 1994 with the objective of providing quality education and training in the field of chemical engineering. Since its inception, the department has been committed to developing skilled engineers equipped with scientific knowledge, technical expertise, and problem-solving abilities to meet the needs of the process industries. The department offers a strong academic foundation supported by modern laboratory facilities and industry-focused learning.",overviewBullets:["The Department of Chemical Engineering was established in 1994 with an intake of 60.","Provides comprehensive knowledge in the fields of Chemical Engineering, Process Engineering, and Industrial Technology.","The curriculum includes Chemical Process Industries, Process Design and Optimization, Heat & Mass Transfer, Fluid Mechanics, Chemical Reaction Engineering, and Process Instrumentation & Control.","Offers exposure to environmental engineering, energy engineering, safety & risk management, and industrial automation.","Emphasizes industry-oriented education, laboratory training, and project-based learning."],labs:["Momentum Transfer Lab","Chemical CAD Lab","Technical Analysis Lab","Heat Transfer Lab","Mechanical Operations Lab","Process Instrumentation and Control Lab","Mass Transfer Lab","Chemical Process Simulation Lab","Petroleum Testing Lab"],careers:["Chemical Manufacturing Industries (Process Control & Plant Operation)","Petrochemical, Refinery, and Fertilizer sectors","Pharmaceutical and Biotech industries","Food and Beverage processing industries","Energy and Environmental Engineering sectors","Process Design, Operation, and Maintenance engineering","Government organizations, public sector undertakings, and R&D institutions","Global employment opportunities in India and abroad"],keyStrengths:["Experienced and highly qualified faculty members","Well-equipped laboratories and pilot-scale facilities","Industry-oriented curriculum and practical training","Strong focus on hands-on learning and research activities","Opportunities for internships, industrial visits, and student projects","Excellent career prospects in chemical and process industries"],hodMessage:"Welcome to the Department of Chemical Engineering at Kongu Polytechnic College. Our department is committed to fostering a strong foundation in chemical engineering principles, practical skills, and innovative thinking. We strive to provide our students with a stimulating learning environment where theoretical knowledge meets hands-on experience. Our dedicated faculty are passionate about guiding students towards academic excellence, research, and industry readiness. Through modern laboratories, industry collaborations, and project-based learning, we aim to nurture the next generation of chemical engineers who can contribute meaningfully to society and the global chemical industry. We invite you to explore our department, discover our programs, and learn about the exciting opportunities that await you at Kongu Polytechnic College.",faculty:[{name:"M. Nandhakumar",designation:"HOD / Senior Grade - 1",doj:"20.05.2010",dob:"20.03.1987",qualification:"M.Tech., MISTE",experience:"16 Years",phone:"8056733774",image:"/assets/departments/Faculty/TEACHING kpc/CHEM/Nandhakumar.webp"},{name:"G. Suthakar",designation:"Senior Grade - 1",doj:"01.12.2011",dob:"14.01.1981",qualification:"M.Tech., MISTE",experience:"14 Years 6 Months",phone:"9789215825",image:"/assets/departments/Faculty/TEACHING kpc/CHEM/Sudhakar.webp"},{name:"D. Sathiya",designation:"Sr. Lecturer",doj:"28.11.2012",dob:"13.08.1990",qualification:"B.Tech., MISTE",experience:"13 Years 6 Months",phone:"9600222955",image:"/assets/departments/Faculty/TEACHING kpc/CHEM/Sathya.webp"},{name:"J.S. David Gandhirajan",designation:"Lecturer",doj:"07.12.2024",dob:"24.01.1998",qualification:"B.E.",experience:"1 Year 6 Months",phone:"8072394405",image:"/assets/departments/Faculty/TEACHING kpc/CHEM/David gandhi.webp"},{name:"K. Prasanthkumar",designation:"Lecturer",doj:"17.11.2025",dob:"03.06.1998",qualification:"B.E.",experience:"0 Years 7 Months",phone:"7502424349",image:"/assets/departments/Faculty/TEACHING kpc/CHEM/Prasanthkumar.webp"},{name:"R. Jagadeesan",designation:"Lab Assistant",doj:"06.08.2014",dob:"26.04.1978",qualification:"I.T.I",experience:"11 Years 10 Months",phone:"9976652940",image:"/assets/departments/Faculty/NONTEACHING kpc/CHEM/jagadeesh.webp"}],alumni:[{name:"R Thulasimani",batch:"2013 Batch",salary:"-",position:"Process Engineer",company:"Dangote Oil Refinery",location:"Nigeria",image:"/assets/departments/CHEM/R Thulasimani.webp"},{name:"Vaseem Vahab V.A",batch:"2013 Batch",salary:"-",position:"Process Engineer",company:"Aqualia (HAAISCO group)",location:"Saudi Arabia",image:"/assets/departments/CHEM/Vaseem Vahab VA.webp"},{name:"Siva Vadivel",batch:"2024 Batch",salary:"-",position:"Asst Engineer",company:"The India Cements Ltd",location:"Sankagiri",image:"/assets/departments/CHEM/Siva Vadivel.webp"},{name:"Rinshad",batch:"2012 Batch",salary:"-",position:"Senior Field Operator",company:"Qatar Petrochemical Company",location:"Qatar",image:"/assets/departments/CHEM/Rinshad.webp"},{name:"Hashil K",batch:"2026 Batch",salary:"-",position:"Production Lead",company:"TVS Motors",location:"Hosur",image:"/assets/departments/CHEM/Hasil K.webp"},{name:"Kalivarnesh P",batch:"2016 Batch",salary:"-",position:"EWA Central Control Room Operator",company:"Al Kooheji Technical Services",location:"Bahrain",image:"/assets/departments/CHEM/Kalivarnesh P.webp"},{name:"R. Gowtham",batch:"2021 Batch",salary:"-",position:"Dril